examples/full/yaml/proxyfile.yaml:23:30: "services.<service name>.health.grpc" is refused by --target haproxy: HAProxy has no gRPC health check: http-check send writes a text body, not the health service's gRPC message; write health.path on the service's http port
examples/full/yaml/proxyfile.yaml:36:3: "auth.jwt" is refused by --target haproxy: HAProxy's jwt_verify takes one key file, with no key set, URL, issuer or audience check; verify the token in the service auth.ask names
