examples/full/yaml/proxyfile.yaml:66:7: "routes[].rpc.retries" is refused by --target haproxy: with retry-on at HAProxy's default, a gRPC call whose connection to the service failed was not sent again, and the wider retry-on that sends it also sends again a request a service may have read; leave retries out of the rpc entry, or render it for envoy
examples/full/yaml/proxyfile.yaml:72:89: "routes[].rate_limit.burst" above 0 is refused by --target haproxy: HAProxy's rate counts the requests of a period and has no burst; write burst: 0 or leave it out, or render it for envoy
